        "content": "## Applicant Screening (CareerMind)\n1. Fill in the **Config** node (company, recruiter email, CareerMind URL, thresholds).\n2. Connect credentials: Google Sheets, Gmail, and a **Header Auth** credential named `CareerMind API Key` (header `x-api-key`, value = the server's CAREERMIND_API_KEY).\n3. Put your sheet ID in **Duplicate Check** and **Save to Sheet** (tab `Applicants`).\n4. Publish, then send a test application to the webhook.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 7
      },
